motive dealers. Further, the company provides retail installment sale contracts for new and used vehicles; and direct financing leases for new vehicles to retail and commercial customers, such as leasing companies, government entities, daily rental companies, and fleet customers. Additionally, it offers wholesale loans to dealers to finance the purchase of vehicle inventory; and loans to dealers to finance working capital and enhance dealership facilities, purchase dealership real estate, and other dealer vehicle programs. Ford Motor Company was incorporated in 1903 and is based in Dearborn, Michigan.","desc_src":"Yahoo Finance profile via yfinance (third-party)","sic":"3711","sic_desc":"Motor Vehicles & Passenger Car Bodies","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Auto Manufacturers","mcap":49047429120,"mcap_src":"Yahoo Finance profile (third-party, cached)","hq":"DEARBORN, MI","exchange":"XNYS","fy_end":"1231","cik":37996,"state_inc":"DE","massive_note":"Massive ticker details not fetched yet (5 calls/min limit; filled in on a nightly run)","sec_asof":"2026-10-03"},"fin":{"available":true,"src":"SEC EDGAR XBRL companyfacts","asof":"2026-09-30","q":[{"end":"2023-06-30","rev":44954000000.0,"rev_yoy":11.9,"eps":0.47,"eps_yoy":193.7,"ni":2016000000.0,"ni_yoy":216.0,"nm":4.5,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2023-09-30","rev":43801000000.0,"rev_yoy":11.2,"eps":0.3,"eps_yoy":"turned +","ni":1173000000.0,"ni_yoy":"turned +","nm":2.7,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2023-12-31","rev":45962000000.0,"rev_yoy":4.5,"eps":-0.13,"eps_yoy":-140.6,"ni":-523000000.0,"ni_yoy":-141.5,"nm":-1.1,"derived":["eps","rev","ni"],"fp":null},{"end":"2024-03-31","rev":42777000000.0,"rev_yoy":3.1,"eps":0.33,"eps_yoy":-25.0,"ni":1334000000.0,"ni_yoy":-19.8,"nm":3.1,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-06-30","rev":47808000000.0,"rev_yoy":6.3,"eps":0.46,"eps_yoy":-2.1,"ni":1833000000.0,"ni_yoy":-9.1,"nm":3.8,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-09-30","rev":46196000000.0,"rev_yoy":5.5,"eps